from pathlib import Path
Path('\\''/tank/dregg-build/claude-lanes/cx-mini-coll/src/docs/decisions/D-0007-scoped-collisions.md'\\'').write_text(\"# D-0007 — Collision reductions name finite compared inputs\\n\\nOwner: CX-MINI-COLL; receiving owner ROOT-for-Mini. Base: 334316df.\\nThis repairs production Mini; nano KERNEL-56 supplied the comparison pattern.\\n\\nAn unbounded collision of an infinite preimage domain into a fixed-width digest is\\ninevitable. Its disjunction cannot express binding. Replace each soundness escape\\nwith Theory.CollidesAmong hash inputs, retaining the original equality/case\\nanalysis and adding membership evidence for the very pair that analysis exhibits.\\nDo not keep the old theorem beside its replacement.\\n\\nPRICE PREMISES (before implementing the affected consumer signatures):\\n- Direct digest, predicate, trie, range, cache, world-root reductions and log-path\\n  reductions: no added hypothesis. Their collision conclusions become stronger.\\n- WorldRoot.rootBinding_of_noCollision: replace global collision-freedom by\\n  separation of the finite comparisons over the two worlds'\\'' supported keys.\\n  This weakens the existing assumption; no additional hypothesis is needed.\\n- DomainEpoch.own_omission_evident, absent_position_holds_fill, omission_evident,\\n  Example.own_omission_evident_instance and Example.omission_evident_instance:\\n  explicitly supply the compared vectors and their Opens/Shaped facts rather\\n  than hiding arbitrary vectors inside Included. The omission conclusion becomes\\n  nonmembership in each supplied candidate vector. Thus callers must supply their\\n  actual inclusion witness; no global injectivity is asserted.\\n- DurableIndex.Answer.sound: expose the actual accepted opening (and its verification)\\n  so the conclusion names its finite inputs. Existing Answer.opens contains an\\n  existential witness; this restatement exposes that witness without changing the\\n  runtime Answer representation.\\n- DurableHistory.verifyAt_sound: no new hypothesis; use the raw nodes already in\\n  its parameters, extracting their acceptance from verifyAt instead of losing the\\n  lookup behind the Verified.included existential.\\n\\nConsumer audit also reaches WorldRoot.deployed_paths/deployedRoot_binds,\\nReceiptContinuity.opens_sound and ReceiptContinuityIO.systemSiblings_open.\\nThe historical eight-site inventory was incomplete. AuthMap.PathBinding and\\nobject-indexed CellState/StoreCodec collisions already constrain their compared\\nobjects and are not replaced blindly. An independent Tower256CshakeMerkleBinding\\nglobal family is outside this consumer chain and is reported to ROOT separately.\\n\\nVacuity read: for each binding disjunct, the intended fact requires the verifier,\\nencoding or recursive equality reasoning. The collision disjunct must fail on an\\ninhabited fixed-width instance with a separating finite list, even when the hash\\ncollides elsewhere. Explicit negative examples (length-hash collisions and\\nhiding-at-equality refutations) intentionally exhibit collisions; they are not\\nbinding claims and now name their exhibited pair too.\\n\\nCritique: larger types expose the actual comparison trace, and explicit witnesses\\nmake omission statements less convenient to call. That cost buys an inspectable\\nclaim whose escape cannot be supplied by an unrelated collision.\\nMeta-critique: a count of scoped predicates alone does not establish nonvacuity.\\nThe check must be paired with finite-width separation witnesses and a real\\ndropped-list mutant of each theorem. The mutation is a proved weakening of the\\nactual declaration and must produce a checked RED, not a scripted error string.\\nNo digest, wire encoding, verification verdict or refusal policy changes.\\n\")

