    split at ok
    · cases ok
    split at ok
    · cases ok
    split at ok
    · cases ok
    · split at ok
      · cases ok; assumption
      · cases ok
  exact LogAccumulator.verify_sound nodeDigest leaves n height within.1 within.2 frontier honest _
    (lookupNode nodes) accepted

