For the omission family, the new universally quantified statement is about each
supplied checked candidate. To recover the old unbounded reduction, choose the
Included witness when one exists and forget the resulting collision membership.
The finite conclusion cannot come from an unrelated preimage collision. It does
not assert unconditional absence from every possible opening under a finite hash.

Decision commit fields for this series use immutable lane-owned Git tag names
(cx-mini-coll-20261021-*) created on their corresponding commits. This allows
